  "positive_native_replacement": {
    "binding": "Actual Golden game Atom init selects native voice interface872ee8; Steam independently uses real WASAPI IAudioClient. Device lifecycle, real channel rendering, native status/ownership and errors use those native providers, not the classic console RNA adapter/server. Complete bodies and exact native identities are hash-sealed dependencies.",
